   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 940,
   "width": 1019,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100084,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700588,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step 3 is the expensive one: a client with 400 friends issues 400 subscriptions. So a deploy that reconnects 10M clients means\n4 BILLION subscription operations - the design's worst operational moment, and the reason subscriptions are batched and\ndeploys are rolled slowly.",
   "originalText": "Step 3 is the expensive one: a client with 400 friends issues 400 subscriptions. So a deploy that reconnects 10M clients means\n4 BILLION subscription operations - the design's worst operational moment, and the reason subscriptions are batched and\ndeploys are rolled slowly.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1006,
   "width": 979,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100085,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700595,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step 4 exists precisely to close a race: a client that connects while a friend's update is in flight misses that publish,\nbecause its server had not yet subscribed. The bulk read covers it - a newly connected client would otherwise see nothing\nuntil each friend's next 30-second update.",
   "originalText": "Step 4 exists precisely to close a race: a client that connects while a friend's update is in flight misses that publish,\nbecause its server had not yet subscribed. The bulk read covers it - a newly connected client would otherwise see nothing\nuntil each friend's next 30-second update.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
