   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "created on login, destroyed on logout",
   "originalText": "created on login, destroyed on logout",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "od",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "pan",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1424,
   "width": 398,
   "height": 120,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100103,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700721,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "An idle Redis pub/sub channel with no subscribers\nconsumes no memory - it is a key in a routing table,\nnot a buffer. So the 205 GB figure is a worst-case\nceiling and the practical memory is far lower.\n\nTrading a bounded, predictable memory ceiling for the\nelimination of a coordination protocol is\nstraightforwardly correct.",
   "originalText": "An idle Redis pub/sub channel with no subscribers\nconsumes no memory - it is a key in a routing table,\nnot a buffer. So the 205 GB figure is a worst-case\nceiling and the practical memory is far lower.\n\nTrading a bounded, predictable memory ceiling for the\nelimination of a coordination protocol is\nstraightforwardly correct.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "odn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 890,
   "y": 1424,
   "width": 428,
   "height": 120,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100104,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700728,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sounds tidier, and creates a real problem: every one of\nthat user's 400 friends' servers must be TOLD the channel\nnow exists so it can subscribe.\n\nThat is a distributed coordination event on every login,\n40 subscription changes triggered by one connect, and a\nrace where a friend's update is published before a\nsubscriber has finished subscribing.",
   "originalText": "Sounds tidier, and creates a real problem: every one of\nthat user's 400 friends' servers must be TOLD the channel\nnow exists so it can subscribe.\n\nThat is a distributed coordination event on every login,\n40 subscription changes triggered by one connect, and a\nrace where a friend's update is published before a\nsubscriber has finished subscribing.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d6",
   "type": "line",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1560,
   "width": 1680,
   "height": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
